.Dd August 1, 2026
.Dt INTEGRIS-ROLE-STUB 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm integris-role-stub
.Nd Integris engineering IPC child for role confinement probes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a Unix-only engineering helper launched by the Integris supervised launcher.
It claims conferred descriptors, applies best-effort platform confinement,
runs negative probes, and performs one authenticated IPC exchange.
.Pp
It is not a product daemon and must not be used as
.Xr integrisd 8 .
See IP-A-0003.
.Pp
The process refuses to start unless
.Ev INTEGRIS_LAUNCH_MODE
is
.Li engineering .
.Ss Descriptors
.Bl -tag -width "fd 4" -compact
.It fd 3
Inherited IPC socket (always).
.It fd 4
Legacy MAC-key file descriptor when key transport is not SCM_RIGHTS.
.El
.Pp
When
.Ev INTEGRIS_KEY_TRANSPORT
is
.Li scm-rights ,
the MAC-key descriptor is received over the IPC socket instead of fd 4.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "INTEGRIS_KEY_TRANSPORT"
.It Ev INTEGRIS_LAUNCH_MODE
Must be
.Li engineering .
.It Ev INTEGRIS_ROLE
Local process role name.
.It Ev INTEGRIS_PEER
Peer role name for the authenticated channel.
.It Ev INTEGRIS_NONCE_HEX
Sixteen-byte nonce encoded as thirty-two hexadecimal characters.
.It Ev INTEGRIS_KEY_TRANSPORT
One of
.Li scm-rights ,
.Li memfd-sealed ,
or
.Li anon-unlinked .
.It Ev INTEGRIS_CONFER
Comma-separated conferred capability tokens for semantic probes.
.It Ev INTEGRIS_SLOTS
Comma-separated slot kinds for semantic probes.
.It Ev INTEGRIS_ALLOW_ROOTS
Colon-separated filesystem allow-roots for confinement adapters.
.It Ev INTEGRIS_STUB_MODE
.Li respond
(default) or
.Li initiate .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Probe and IPC exchange completed.
.It 1
Missing descriptors, invalid environment, confinement/IPC failure, or
non-engineering launch mode.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# Invoked by the supervised launcher / tests; not a user-facing CLI.
# INTEGRIS_LAUNCH_MODE=engineering INTEGRIS_ROLE=... INTEGRIS_PEER=... \\
#   INTEGRIS_NONCE_HEX=... integris-role-stub
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr integris-crash-stub 1 ,
.Xr integris 7 ,
.Xr integrisd 8
.Pp
.Pa docs/ip/IP-A-0003-supervised-launcher.md ,
.Pa docs/platform-matrix.md ,
.Pa docs/security-architecture.md
.Sh HISTORY
Introduced for M2 prelude confinement and authority inventory probes.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Integris contributors
.Sh CAVEATS
Available only on Unix builds (//go:build unix).
Do not install as a system service.
See
.Pa TRADEMARKS.md .
